      "description": "The study will provide communities with access to free PDPT for heterosexuals with gonorrhea or chlamydial infection. PDPT will be packaged to meet the requirements of the WA State Board of Pharmacy and will include 1gram of azithromycin, information about STD, condoms, and information about enclosed medication in English and Spanish. PDPT packs for gonorrhea will also include 400mg of cefixime.",
