      "description": "During intervention periods, communities will receive public health partner services (PS) provided by Disease Intervention Specialists (DIS). Diagnosing clinicians will triage their patients to receive PS based on defined criteria associated with not ensuring partners' treatment. PS will include an offer to notify partners for each index case. When DIS notify partners they will offer them the opportunity to obtain free medication at a local pharmacy, at a clinic (as available) or through the mail. DIS will also offer to refer partners for complete evaluations insofar as such care is available in local communities.",
